    "summary_insights": [
      "The company maintains a very strong liquidity position, with the current ratio improving from 2.78x to 4.44x in FY26.",
      "Net assets grew by 14.9% year-on-year, reaching £7.87m, driven by retained profits despite a 40.3% decline in net profit.",
      "Working capital composition has shifted significantly, with trade receivables decreasing by 28.7% while inventory increased by 26.3%.",
      "The business is materially cash-positive with negligible long-term debt, resulting in a gearing ratio of less than 0.1%.",
      "Trade payables were reduced by over 56% (£1.29m), indicating a substantial deleveraging of the short-term creditor base.",
